# What a costume tells the player wearing it, and the command that takes it off.
desc.family = Costumes other players put on you
desc.off = Take off any costume you are wearing
notice.dressed = You are wearing a costume. Type /zigcostume off to take it off.
notice.dressed_by = {0} put a costume on you. Type /zigcostume off to take it off.
off.done = Your costume is off.
off.none = You are not wearing a costume.
off.needs_player = Only a player can take off a costume.
